{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "9f251252-d74a-82b5-afa5-6561e502da34",
  "created_at": "2025-12-04T12:24:27-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Zoning and Inspections",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Frank Barone",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Greg Lombardi",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-04T12:21:13-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Zoning and Inspections, this is Greg."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-04T12:21:16-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, hello. Um, I am calling because I want to build a deck. Second story, on the back of a house I own. I rent it, the units."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-04T12:21:27-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, so you're the landlord. A second-story deck, yeah, that needs a deck permit. Are you doing the work yourself or hiring somebody?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-04T12:21:36-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Myself, with my cousin's... how you say... his crew. Two guys. But I already lose one morning, because I think I need some paper and nobody tell me what paper."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-04T12:21:48-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Right, that's what I'm here for. What do you want to know?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-04T12:21:53-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "The railing. How high it must be? I look online and one site says thirty-six, another says forty-two. This is, uh, wasting my time."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-04T12:22:02-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, that's the usual mix-up. Thirty-six is commonly for a single-family home. Forty-two is often for multi-family or commercial. Since you've got tenants, you're probably looking at the higher one. But the plan reviewer will confirm that when you submit."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-04T12:22:17-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "So I should... [pause] I should build forty-two to be safe."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-04T12:22:22-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I'd say plan on forty-two, and the spacing between the balusters matters too. Keep it tight, a small child shouldn't fit a head through. Put all that on your drawing."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-04T12:22:34-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Drawing. I need a drawing also?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-04T12:22:38-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, a simple one is fine. Size of the deck, height off the ground, how it attaches to the house, the footings, the railing. Hand-drawn works if it's neat and clear."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-04T12:22:50-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "And then, after, somebody comes to inspect? Or I just build and done?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-04T12:22:56-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Oh, you'll have inspections. Typically one for the footings before you pour or cover them, and a final when it's finished. Sometimes a framing check in between. The permit tells you which ones."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-04T12:23:09-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Footings first. Okay. How I schedule this? I call, or there is a form?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-04T12:23:15-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You call the office when you're ready, and give your permit number. Don't pour anything until the inspector's seen the holes."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-04T12:23:23-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good, good. Because the last time, with other job, I wait in the driveway for the inspector, and my truck, it's old, it takes a long time to start every morning, so I was late to everything. Wicked, uh, very annoying."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-04T12:23:38-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Well, they'll usually give you a window. You can ask for morning or afternoon when you call, and they'll try to work with you."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-04T12:23:47-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. That is something. And the permit, I can get it where?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-04T12:23:52-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Here at City Hall, in this office. Bring the drawing, your contractor info if someone's doing the work, and the property details. If you're doing it yourself as the owner, there are some extra rules, so mention that at the counter."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-04T12:24:07-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Fine. I come tomorrow, then. I hope this time is not another trip for nothing."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-04T12:24:13-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "If you've got the drawing with the railing and footings on it, you should be in good shape. We're open till four-thirty."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-04T12:24:22-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Thank you. Goodbye."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-04T12:24:24-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You got it. Take care."
    }
  ],
